{"file": "天才机甲师-第5集.mp4", "ep": 5, "duration": 129.7, "segments": [{"start": 10.38, "end": 12.18, "text": "这些杂鱼没有自主意识"}, {"start": 12.18, "end": 13.86, "text": "是脑虫在操控他们"}, {"start": 13.86, "end": 16.21, "text": "那就简单吧"}, {"start": 16.21, "end": 17.53, "text": "杀你一个"}, {"start": 17.53, "end": 19.14, "text": "全得死"}, {"start": 19.14, "end": 20.26, "text": "竹笼"}, {"start": 20.26, "end": 62.99, "text": "但你的机甲"}, {"start": 62.99, "end": 65.38, "text": "是在虫群面前"}, {"start": 65.38, "end": 66.5, "text": "不开一击"}, {"start": 66.5, "end": 67.26, "text": "军坛"}, {"start": 67.26, "end": 69.1, "text": "他在用自身的能量复活他们"}, {"start": 69.1, "end": 70.62, "text": "那我就不给你留能量"}, {"start": 70.62, "end": 71.92, "text": "散开"}, {"start": 71.92, "end": 79.86, "text": "必加结构百分之三十"}, {"start": 79.86, "end": 80.46, "text": "人类"}, {"start": 80.46, "end": 81.54, "text": "我该主意了"}, {"start": 81.54, "end": 84.28, "text": "让你献给女皇"}, {"start": 84.28, "end": 91.74, "text": "不好意思"}, {"start": 91.74, "end": 92.98, "text": "我已婚"}, {"start": 92.98, "end": 97.05, "text": "脑虫兵死"}, {"start": 97.05, "end": 98.73, "text": "是否接纳残余精神频率"}, {"start": 98.73, "end": 99.41, "text": "选择一"}, {"start": 99.41, "end": 100.21, "text": "屏蔽信号"}, {"start": 100.29, "end": 101.61, "text": "奖励机械精准度提升"}, {"start": 101.61, "end": 102.13, "text": "选择二"}, {"start": 102.13, "end": 102.85, "text": "接纳频率"}, {"start": 102.85, "end": 104.17, "text": "奖励被动虫群共鸣"}, {"start": 104.17, "end": 105.53, "text": "大幅提升虫族感之力"}, {"start": 105.53, "end": 105.97, "text": "警告"}, {"start": 105.97, "end": 107.61, "text": "可能造成精神危险"}, {"start": 107.61, "end": 108.41, "text": "我选二"}, {"start": 108.41, "end": 109.73, "text": "人类"}, {"start": 109.73, "end": 112.7, "text": "历亡"}, {"start": 112.7, "end": 114.58, "text": "万岁"}, {"start": 114.58, "end": 120.71, "text": "你到底是什么人"}, {"start": 120.71, "end": 122.3, "text": "一个人干掉了一整只花园"}, {"start": 122.3, "end": 123.5, "text": "这种货色"}, {"start": 123.5, "end": 125.2, "text": "我还能打十个"}, {"start": 125.2, "end": 126.32, "text": "好像有点"}, {"start": 126.32, "end": 127.4, "text": "装过头了"}, {"start": 127.4, "end": 128.4, "text": "大兄弟"}]}